    "Not a C ledger. Natural shorter forms (incl. abbreviations that arise from translation) are allowed.",
    "Keys are normalized lookup forms (lowercased Latin; CJK kept as-is). Values are {lang: text} candidates.",
    "Chooser picks the lowest estimate_tokens among original + candidates; keeps original on ties.",
    "EN+ZH+JA was the starting mix, not a hard ceiling. In-scope for B token-min and LID include:",
    "  Romance (es, fr, pt, it), Germanic (de, nl, en), Greek (el), plus ja/zh and other script tags LID can emit.",
    "Default allow_langs=None accepts any bank language. Live MT is opt-in (--translate-engine); fixtures keep CI deterministic."
